<title>USA: Lincoln National to buy CIGNA's life unit.</title>
<headline>Lincoln National to buy CIGNA's life unit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lincoln National said on Monday it will buy CIGNA Corp.'s individual life insurance and annuity business for about $1.4 billion in cash.</p>
<p>Lincoln National said the deal, which is subject to regulatory approvals and is expected to close by year-end, should add to its 1998 earnings immediately.</p>
</text>
